DFlash2 drafting for Flash Next on the native CUDA engine (--drafter DIR; flash-3's drafter, ported): a 4-bit copy of the 5-layer drafter, taps after layers 5/15/25/35/45, block drafts of 7 with a selector, in the lane backend. Knobs: TF_FLASHNEXT_DFLASH_DRAFTS (7), _CONFIDENCE (0.5), _COPIES (1; the recipe sets 0), _TIMING. Verified: greedy and sampled replies byte-identical with drafts off, in 17 checks (4 clients, resumed turn, 6K/25K prompts, vision).

